# European robin

The European robin is the robin in this notebook. Its name is the key
`european-robin`; [[field-notes]] records one observation.

The route visits this species before [[barn-owl]] and [[common-raven]].
That positional choice is preserved by an ordered map even though its key
comes last when the same keys are sorted alphabetically.
